<title>UK: UK gilt auction  -- full results.</title>
<headline>UK gilt auction  -- full results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are full results</p>
<p>of the UK gilt auction</p>
<p>ISSUER: H M Treasury</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 2.0 bln</p>
<p>COUPON: 7.25 percent</p>
<p>MATURITY: 2007</p>
<p>COVER: 2.7 TIMES</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACEPTED YIELD:7.13%</p>
<p>LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE:100-24</p>
<p>PCT ALLOCATED AT LOWEST PRICE: 14.5%</p>
<p>NOTES:The yield tail was one basis point and the price tail 2/32. A total of 5.421 billion pounds in bids was received.</p>
</text>
